OL,3,GNEWSAWork to start next year on new
OL,4,Apolice station
OL,5,
OL,6,FBuilding work on a new police station
OL,7,Fis expected to begin next year,
OL,8,Faccording to a council.
OL,10,FNorth Lincolnshire Council and the
OL,11,FPolice and Crime Commissioner have
OL,12,Fagreed plans for the new building in
OL,13,FScunthorpe's Elizabeth Quarter. It will
OL,14,Freplace the existing police facilities
OL,15,Fon Corporation Road.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,387,380,200,160,0,100
