OL,3,GNEWSAWork to start next year on new
OL,4,Apolice station
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncil leader Rob Waltham said:
OL,7,F"People have repeatedly told us they
OL,8,Fwant to see a stronger police presence
OL,9,Fand to feel safer when they come into
OL,10,Ftown. Putting a modern police station
OL,11,Fright at the heart of Scunthorpe
OL,12,Fdirectly responds to that."
OL,14,FHowever business owner Anna Tavares
OL,15,Fsaid she did not think the new location
OL,16,Fwould act as a deterrent towards crime.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
